# Generated by python -m ridge.deck_narrative --write. Scenario wording is
# rendered from assets/scenario-narrative-v1.json; do not retype it here.
pageType: content
audience: participant
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 400, 16]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: PART 2 · HOW THE DAY WORKS — PHASE 1 OF 4}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 66, 528, 31]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.title
    content: {style: "$title", fontSize: 27, wrap: false, text: What actually left the network}
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 116, 832, 2]
    viewBox: [832, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 832,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: tickets-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 64, 296, 14]
    content: {fontSize: 11, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, align: [right, top], text: TICKETS IN THIS PHASE}
  - elementId: tickets
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 82, 296, 16]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.tickets
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$slate", align: [right, top], text: T01 · T02 · T03}
  - elementId: timeframe
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 128, 832, 17]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.timeframe
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: "Orientation, then the first look at the network record"}
  - elementId: purpose-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 166, 396, 19]
    content: {fontSize: 15, bold: true, color: "$slate", wrap: false, text: PURPOSE}
  - elementId: purpose-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 193, 396, 2]
    viewBox: [396, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 396,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: purpose
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 205, 396, 90]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.purpose
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>Establish the outbound path before worrying about cause. Your team decides here whether this is a document leaving a network, or a document leaving a network and continuing somewhere you cannot see.</p>
  - elementId: urgency-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 166, 396, 19]
    content: {fontSize: 15, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, text: URGENCY}
  - elementId: urgency-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [500, 193, 396, 2]
    viewBox: [396, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 396,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: urgency
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 205, 396, 67]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.urgency
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>High and bounded. Nothing downstream is worth doing until you can describe the transfer in one sentence that a stranger could check.</p>
  - elementId: action-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 327, 832, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, text: WHAT YOU DO HERE}
  - elementId: action-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 349, 832, 2]
    viewBox: [832, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 832,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: action
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 361, 832, 47]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.action
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 15
      text: |
        <p>Claim one of the three network tickets. Work the capture and the name lookups. Write down the path you can actually support.</p>
  - elementId: transition-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 418, 832, 16]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$amber", wrap: false, text: AND THEN}
  - elementId: transition-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 440, 832, 2]
    viewBox: [832, 2]
    points: "0,1.0 832,1.0"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: transition
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 452, 832, 44]
    contractRef: phases.phase-1.transition
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>Once the path is on the record, the question moves from the wire to the machine that sent it. The same team that described the transfer now has to explain it.</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 505, 700, 15]
    content: {fontSize: 12, color: "#7E877F", wrap: false, text: OPERATION SILENT RIDGE — EXERCISE ONLY}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 505, 40, 15]
    content: {fontSize: 12, color: "#7E877F", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "8"}
